{"timestamp":"2026-09-03T17:51:54.582061Z","level":"info","event":"    \"summary_description\": \"<p><span style=\\\"color: black;\\\">The TCEP-SE under assistance listing 10.517, provides informal, community-focused extension pilot projects at 1994 Institutions. Pilot projects may focus on community needs that address emerging issues such as agricultural productivity, improving food systems, community vitality, workforce and economic development, public health and well-being, engaging Tribal youths, and preparing the next generation of Tribal agriculture leaders.</span></p>\",","logger":"task.stdout"}
